Package: cfdns-updater
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, curl, systemd
Maintainer: Eduardo Macan <eduardomacan@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/eduardomacan/cfdns-updater
Description: Cloudflare dynamic DNS updater
 Monitors the public IP address and updates a Cloudflare DNS A record
 when it changes. Runs as the dns-updater systemd service.
